@startuml
title Consume Decision State - Visible Code Enum And Runtime Cause From Code

' 状态图保持默认黑白，不引入模块颜色。

legend right
  代码枚举节点直接显示真实来源：枚举类.枚举值
  示例：ConsumeDecision.ACK / SendFailureType.VALIDATION_ERROR
  LOGICAL = 查询、时间、次数、配置推导，代码枚举中不存在
  RUNTIME = 执行过程节点，代码枚举中不存在
  ACTION = repository / adapter 动作，不是状态枚举
  PROVIDER ACTION = Kafka / Pulsar / RocketMQ 原生确认动作
  PROVIDER CAUSE = Provider 原生返回或异常，不是统一状态枚举
  MESSAGE SEMANTIC = message-component 语义，目前不是持久化枚举
endlegend

state "DECISION_PENDING\n[CAUSE]\nwaiting for handler/idempotency/template result" as C_PENDING

state "ACK\nConsumeDecision.ACK" as D_ACK
state "RETRY\nConsumeDecision.RETRY" as D_RETRY
state "DISCARD\nConsumeDecision.DISCARD" as D_DISCARD
state "DEAD_LETTER\nConsumeDecision.DEAD_LETTER" as D_DEAD_LETTER

state "NONE\nConsumeFailureType.NONE" as F_NONE
state "DECODE_ERROR\nConsumeFailureType.DECODE_ERROR" as F_DECODE_ERROR
state "CONSUMER_NOT_FOUND\nConsumeFailureType.CONSUMER_NOT_FOUND" as F_CONSUMER_NOT_FOUND
state "HANDLER_ERROR\nConsumeFailureType.HANDLER_ERROR" as F_HANDLER_ERROR
state "IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT\nConsumeFailureType.IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT" as F_IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
state "IDEMPOTENCY_STORAGE_ERROR\nConsumeFailureType.IDEMPOTENCY_STORAGE_ERROR" as F_IDEMPOTENCY_STORAGE
state "TRANSACTION_ERROR\nConsumeFailureType.TRANSACTION_ERROR" as F_TRANSACTION_ERROR
state "ACK_ERROR\nConsumeFailureType.ACK_ERROR" as F_ACK_ERROR
state "PROVIDER_ERROR\nConsumeFailureType.PROVIDER_ERROR" as F_PROVIDER_ERROR
state "UNKNOWN_ERROR\nConsumeFailureType.UNKNOWN_ERROR" as F_UNKNOWN_ERROR

state "ACQUIRED\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.ACQUIRED" as A_ACQUIRED
state "DUPLICATE_SUCCESS\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.DUPLICATE_SUCCESS" as A_DUP_SUCCESS
state "DUPLICATE_DISCARDED\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.DUPLICATE_DISCARDED" as A_DUP_DISCARDED
state "PROCESSING\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.PROCESSING" as A_PROCESSING
state "REJECTED\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.REJECTED" as A_REJECTED
state "STORAGE_ERROR\nIdempotentAcquireStatus.STORAGE_ERROR" as A_STORAGE_ERROR

state "RETRY\nMessageIdempotencyFailurePolicy.RETRY" as P_RETRY
state "DISCARD\nMessageIdempotencyFailurePolicy.DISCARD" as P_DISCARD
state "DEAD_LETTER\nMessageIdempotencyFailurePolicy.DEAD_LETTER" as P_DEAD_LETTER

state "HANDLER_RETURNS_ACK\n[CAUSE]\nhandler returns ACK" as C_HANDLER_ACK
state "HANDLER_RETURNS_RETRY\n[CAUSE]\nhandler returns RETRY/null" as C_HANDLER_RETRY
state "HANDLER_RETURNS_DISCARD\n[CAUSE]\nhandler returns DISCARD" as C_HANDLER_DISCARD
state "HANDLER_THROWS\n[CAUSE]\nhandler throws exception" as C_HANDLER_EXCEPTION
state "MISSING_CONSUMER\n[CAUSE]\nConsumerDefinition not found" as C_MISSING_CONSUMER
state "DECODE_FAILURE\n[CAUSE]\nwire decode failed" as C_DECODE_FAILURE
state "MARK_SUCCESS_FAILED\n[CAUSE]\nmarkSuccess failed or ownerToken mismatch" as C_MARK_SUCCESS_FAILED
state "MARK_DISCARDED_FAILED\n[CAUSE]\nmarkDiscarded failed" as C_MARK_DISCARDED_FAILED
state "TRANSACTION_ROLLBACK\n[CAUSE]\ntransaction rollback" as C_TX_ROLLBACK

state "KAFKA_COMMIT_NEXT_OFFSET\nKafkaConsumeAction.COMMIT_NEXT_OFFSET" as P_KAFKA_COMMIT
state "KAFKA_RETRY_WITHOUT_COMMIT\nKafkaConsumeAction.RETRY_WITHOUT_COMMIT" as P_KAFKA_RETRY
state "PULSAR_ACKNOWLEDGE\nPulsarConsumeAction.ACKNOWLEDGE" as P_PULSAR_ACK
state "PULSAR_NEGATIVE_ACKNOWLEDGE\nPulsarConsumeAction.NEGATIVE_ACKNOWLEDGE" as P_PULSAR_NEG
state "ROCKETMQ_CONSUME_SUCCESS\nRocketMqConsumeAction.CONSUME_SUCCESS" as P_ROCKET_SUCCESS
state "ROCKETMQ_RECONSUME_LATER\nRocketMqConsumeAction.RECONSUME_LATER" as P_ROCKET_RETRY

[*] --> C_PENDING

C_PENDING --> A_ACQUIRED : idempotency acquire result
A_ACQUIRED --> C_HANDLER_ACK
A_ACQUIRED --> C_HANDLER_RETRY
A_ACQUIRED --> C_HANDLER_DISCARD
A_ACQUIRED --> C_HANDLER_EXCEPTION

C_HANDLER_ACK --> F_NONE
F_NONE --> D_ACK
C_HANDLER_RETRY --> F_HANDLER_ERROR
F_HANDLER_ERROR --> D_RETRY
C_HANDLER_DISCARD --> D_DISCARD
C_HANDLER_EXCEPTION --> F_HANDLER_ERROR
F_HANDLER_ERROR --> D_RETRY

C_PENDING --> A_DUP_SUCCESS
A_DUP_SUCCESS --> D_ACK : skip handler
C_PENDING --> A_DUP_DISCARDED
A_DUP_DISCARDED --> D_ACK : skip handler
C_PENDING --> A_PROCESSING
A_PROCESSING --> F_IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
F_IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT --> D_RETRY
C_PENDING --> A_STORAGE_ERROR
A_STORAGE_ERROR --> F_IDEMPOTENCY_STORAGE
F_IDEMPOTENCY_STORAGE --> D_RETRY
C_PENDING --> A_REJECTED
A_REJECTED --> P_RETRY
A_REJECTED --> P_DISCARD
A_REJECTED --> P_DEAD_LETTER
P_RETRY --> D_RETRY
P_DISCARD --> D_DISCARD
P_DEAD_LETTER --> D_DEAD_LETTER

C_PENDING --> C_MISSING_CONSUMER
C_MISSING_CONSUMER --> F_CONSUMER_NOT_FOUND
F_CONSUMER_NOT_FOUND --> D_RETRY : configured RETRY
F_CONSUMER_NOT_FOUND --> D_DISCARD : configured DISCARD

C_PENDING --> C_DECODE_FAILURE
C_DECODE_FAILURE --> F_DECODE_ERROR
F_DECODE_ERROR --> D_RETRY : configured RETRY
F_DECODE_ERROR --> D_DISCARD : configured DISCARD

C_PENDING --> C_MARK_SUCCESS_FAILED
C_MARK_SUCCESS_FAILED --> F_IDEMPOTENCY_STORAGE
C_MARK_SUCCESS_FAILED --> D_RETRY : cannot ack without SUCCESS

C_PENDING --> C_MARK_DISCARDED_FAILED
C_MARK_DISCARDED_FAILED --> F_IDEMPOTENCY_STORAGE
C_MARK_DISCARDED_FAILED --> D_RETRY

C_PENDING --> C_TX_ROLLBACK
C_TX_ROLLBACK --> F_TRANSACTION_ERROR
F_TRANSACTION_ERROR --> D_RETRY

D_ACK --> P_KAFKA_COMMIT
D_ACK --> P_PULSAR_ACK
D_ACK --> P_ROCKET_SUCCESS
D_DISCARD --> P_KAFKA_COMMIT
D_DISCARD --> P_PULSAR_ACK
D_DISCARD --> P_ROCKET_SUCCESS
D_RETRY --> P_KAFKA_RETRY
D_RETRY --> P_PULSAR_NEG
D_RETRY --> P_ROCKET_RETRY
D_DEAD_LETTER --> [*] : v13 reserved, full DLQ later

P_KAFKA_COMMIT --> [*]
P_PULSAR_ACK --> [*]
P_ROCKET_SUCCESS --> [*]
P_KAFKA_RETRY --> [*]
P_PULSAR_NEG --> [*]
P_ROCKET_RETRY --> [*]

note right of D_ACK
  ConsumeDecision.ACK 代表“Provider 可以确认消息”。
  它可能来自业务成功，也可能来自 DUPLICATE_SUCCESS / DUPLICATE_DISCARDED。
end note

note right of D_DISCARD
  DISCARD 是 ConsumeDecision 枚举。
  Provider 侧通常与 ACK 一样确认消息，但业务语义是明确忽略。
end note
@enduml
